'''Medama-Oyaji''' (目玉おやじ, Lit. "Eyeball Father") is an enemy that appears in the [[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Medama-Oyaji
|image = E 459.png
